<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Katie Kratzer — Contemporary Painter</title><meta name="description" content="Selected paintings and studio practice of Katie Kratzer, Pacific Northwest."/></head>
<body><header><a class="brand" href="/">Katie Kratzer</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#studio">Studio</a><a href="#available">Available Works</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">Painting · Pacific Northwest</p><h1>Between intuition<br/>and intention.</h1><p class="lede">An exploration of color, embodied perception and the relationships that connect us.</p><a class="link" href="#work">View selected work ↗</a></div><figure><img src={works[0].image+'?format=1500w'} alt="Corridor to Clarity, abstract painting with green, yellow and burgundy color fields" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><i>{works[0].title}</i><span>2026</span></figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="work"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Selected Works</h2><span>2023–2026</span></div><div class="works">{works.slice(1).map(w=><figure><img src={w.image+'?format=1500w'} alt={'Abstract painting by Katie Kratzer, '+w.year} loading="lazy"/><figcaption><i>{w.title}</i><span>{w.year}</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
<section id="about" class="editorial"><h2>About</h2><div><p>Katie Kratzer is a painter based on Mercer Island, Washington. Her practice brings together expansive color, intuitive gesture and the compositional discipline of a formal design education.</p><p>Working primarily on raw canvas, she explores the relationship between perception, emotion and interconnectedness.</p></div></section>
<section id="studio" class="editorial"><h2>Studio</h2><div><p>Painting begins with a letting go of predetermined composition. Spontaneous marks evolve through sustained observation, creating a dialogue between instinct and intention.</p></div></section>
<section id="available" class="editorial"><h2>Available Works</h2><div><p>For current availability, acquisition pricing or additional artwork images, please contact the studio.</p><a class="link" href="mailto:katherine.kratzer@gmail.com">Request catalogue ↗</a></div></section>
</main><footer id="contact"><div><h2>Contact</h2><p>Gallery, exhibition and acquisition inquiries</p><a href="mailto:katherine.kratzer@gmail.com">Email the studio ↗</a><br/><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kratzer.studio/">Instagram ↗</a></div><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Katie Kratzer</small></footer></body></html>
